    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Upper Planes Pact Feat)</em></p><p>Your commitment to your planar pact grants you the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Ysgardian Spirit.</strong> When you become Bloodied, you gain Advantage on the next attack roll you make before the end of your next turn, and if it hits, you can deal extra damage to the target equal to your Proficiency Bonus, of the same type as the attack. Once you use this benefit, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p>",
